phone-shutdown-progress.patch（xnu-12377 版）

来源：本项目 UniXNU-Pagani_SM8750-gpu/patches/xnu/phone-shutdown-progress.patch（10063）。
处理：保留，无模糊。unmount_callback 在 12377 相同。
作用：关机时每个卷的卸载写进 ramoops，日志能穿过 panic。

diff --git a/bsd/kern/kern_exec.c b/bsd/kern/kern_exec.c
index 227f9ff..9cca789 100644
--- a/bsd/kern/kern_exec.c
+++ b/bsd/kern/kern_exec.c
@@ -354,6 +354,19 @@ extern int nextpidversion;
  * path is what tells them apart.
  */
 int pagani_app_execs = 0;
+/*
+ * phone-shutdown-progress.patch. A shutdown's unmounts in the boot log: their printfs only reach the msgbuf, which ended 3 s short of the panic of
+ * run 20261031-223924, and the records of the log come through a panic. In this file because it is built with the log on: vfs_subr.c is not one of
+ * the objects the second pass of scripts/build-xnu-4k-baseline.sh rebuilds, the macro would stay empty there without a word.
+ */
+void pagani_shutdown_progress(const char *stage, const char *name, uint64_t value);
+
+void
+pagani_shutdown_progress(const char *stage, const char *name, uint64_t value)
+{
+	boot_progress_root(stage, name, value);
+}
+
 
 
